   00211| /// The first place a request's quotes stop pairing, or `None` when they pair.
   00212| ///
   00213| /// `escaped` is a backslash before a quote that opens a literal, or before
   00214| /// one that closes it with a word straight after; `unpaired` is an opening
   00215| /// quote no literal holds. An apostrophe (a quote after a letter or digit)
